#: properties.py:344
msgid "Discrete color bands, like elevation contour lines: every value within a band gets the SAME flat color, with a crisp edge wherever the band changes -- the classic FEA 'banded contour' plot. Band count set below"
msgstr "离散色带，类似等高线：同一色带内的所有数值使用相同的纯色，色带交界处边缘锐利——经典的 FEA「色带等值图」。色带数量在下方设置"

#: properties.py:318
msgid "Displacement"
msgstr "位移"

#: properties.py:392
msgid "Draw a directional arrow at every load object (pointing along its force vector) and a fixed-support hatch mark at every support object (one hatch patch per locked X/Y/Z axis), directly in the 3D viewport. Purely a visual aid -- turn off if you find it cluttered"
msgstr "直接在 3D 视图中在每个载荷物体处绘制方向箭头（沿其力矢量），并在每个支撑物体处绘制固定支撑斜线标记（每个锁定的 X/Y/Z 轴一个斜线块）。纯属视觉辅助——觉得杂乱可关闭"

