msgid "Force"
msgstr "力"

#: ui.py:111
msgid "Force (N; e.g. 100 kN, 2.5 MN):"
msgstr "力（N；例如 100 kN、2.5 MN）："

#: properties.py:190
msgid "Force direction and magnitude in NEWTONS (N), X/Y/Z. It scales the reported stress and safety factor directly. Example: (0, 0, -100) is 100 N straight down"
msgstr "力的大小（牛顿，N）和方向 X/Y/Z。它直接缩放所报告的应力和安全系数。例如：(0, 0, -100) 表示竖直向下 100 N"

#: properties.py:340
msgid "Full-resolution color gradient -- every voxel cell (surface results) or cube (cross-section) gets its own exact color along a smooth blue-to-red scale"
msgstr "全分辨率颜色渐变——每个体素单元（表面结果）或立方体（剖面）都沿平滑的蓝到红刻度获得自己的精确颜色"

