#: properties.py:272
msgid "Isotropic material preset. Applying a preset (button below) copies reference values into the editable fields -- pick Custom to enter your own from a datasheet"
msgstr "各向同性材料预设。应用预设（下方按钮）会将参考值复制到可编辑字段——选择「自定义」可从数据表输入你自己的值"

