#: properties.py:34
msgid "Pick CPU or GPU automatically from problem size: small grids stay on the CPU (a GPU would be slower once you count transfer overhead), larger grids move to the GPU (GPU edition only)"
msgstr "根据问题规模自动选择 CPU 或 GPU：小网格留在 CPU（计入传输开销后 GPU 反而更慢），较大的网格转到 GPU（仅 GPU 版）"

