msgid "Poisson's ratio (how much the material bulges sideways when compressed)"
msgstr "泊松比（材料受压时横向膨胀的程度）"

#: properties.py:133
msgid "Prevent movement along X at this support. Turn off to allow the part to slide along X here (e.g. a roller)"
msgstr "阻止此支撑沿 X 移动。关闭可允许零件在此处沿 X 滑动（例如滚轮）"

#: properties.py:137
msgid "Prevent movement along Y at this support"
msgstr "阻止此支撑沿 Y 移动"

#: properties.py:140
msgid "Prevent movement along Z at this support"
msgstr "阻止此支撑沿 Z 移动"

#: properties.py:263
msgid "Print the chosen compute backend, device/worker counts, BLAS thread count and CG iteration/convergence info to the console (Window > Toggle System Console)"
msgstr "将所选计算后端、设备/工作进程数、BLAS 线程数以及 CG 迭代/收敛信息打印到控制台（窗口 > 切换系统控制台）"

