msgid "Shading"
msgstr "着色"

#: properties.py:367
msgid "Show Convergence Plot"
msgstr "显示收敛图"

#: properties.py:392
msgid "Show Force/Support Symbols"
msgstr "显示力/支撑符号"

#: properties.py:362
msgid "Show Legend"
msgstr "显示图例"

#: properties.py:307
msgid "Show Result"
msgstr "显示结果"

#: properties.py:373
msgid "Show Setup (Part / Supports / Loads)"
msgstr "显示设置（零件/支撑/载荷）"

#: properties.py:244
msgid "Show compute backend detail (thread count, device status). Auto-opens when you pick a non-Auto Compute mode"
msgstr "显示计算后端详情（线程数、设备状态）。选择非「自动」计算模式时自动展开"

#: properties.py:382
msgid "Show support/load helper objects as wireframe as soon as they're assigned (the previous, always-on behaviour). Turn off to leave newly-assigned helpers at whatever display they already had. Turning this off also forces every already-wireframed helper back to solid immediately"
msgstr "支撑/载荷辅助物体一经指定即以线框显示（即此前的常开行为）。关闭后，新指定的辅助物体保持其原有显示方式。关闭此项还会立即将所有已线框化的辅助物体恢复为实体显示"

#: properties.py:367
msgid "Show the CG residual-vs-iteration overlay while solving, and leave the finished curve on screen afterwards"
msgstr "求解时显示 CG 残差随迭代变化的叠加图，完成后将最终曲线保留在屏幕上"

#: properties.py:362
msgid "Show the on-screen color-scale legend in the 3D viewport while a result is visible"
msgstr "结果可见时，在 3D 视图中显示屏幕上的颜色刻度图例"

#: properties.py:373
msgid "Show the part and the support/load helper objects in the viewport. Automatically turned off right after a solve finishes, since they only ever cover the result overlay -- toggle back on to edit the setup and re-run"
msgstr "在视图中显示零件及支撑/载荷辅助物体。求解完成后会自动关闭，因为它们只会遮挡结果叠加显示——重新开启即可编辑设置并再次运行"

#: properties.py:225
msgid "Solve on this many slightly shifted voxel grids and report the median with its range. Which voxels count as material depends on where the grid falls on the part; with few voxels across a wall one grid alone can be off by tens of percent. 1 = single grid (fastest)"
msgstr "在此数量的略微偏移的体素网格上求解，并报告中位数及其范围。哪些体素算作材料取决于网格相对零件的位置；当壁厚方向体素数很少时，单个网格的误差可达数十个百分点。1 = 单网格（最快）"

#: properties.py:275
msgid "Steel"
msgstr "钢"

#: properties.py:126
msgid "Support mesh"
msgstr "支撑网格"

#: ui.py:74
msgid "Supports & Loads"
msgstr "支撑与载荷"

#: ui.py:85
msgid "Supports (bearings)"
msgstr "支撑（支座）"

#: properties.py:318
msgid "Surface mesh colored by displacement magnitude in mm (blue = least movement, red = most)"
msgstr "按位移大小（单位 mm）着色的表面网格（蓝色 = 位移最小，红色 = 位移最大）"

#: properties.py:321
msgid "Surface mesh colored by safety factor = yield / von Mises stress (blue/green = safe, red = at or below yield). Requires Yield Strength > 0"
msgstr "按安全系数 = 屈服强度 / von Mises 应力着色的表面网格（蓝色/绿色 = 安全，红色 = 达到或低于屈服）。需要屈服强度 > 0"

#: properties.py:312
msgid "Surface mesh colored by von Mises stress (blue = low, red = high). The color scale ignores the top ~1% of elements (the singular stress spikes that always sit right at point loads/supports on a voxel grid); the true unclamped max is still reported in the status line and the legend"
msgstr "按 von Mises 应力着色的表面网格（蓝色 = 低，红色 = 高）。色标忽略最高的约 1% 单元（在体素网格上，这些奇异应力尖峰总是出现在点载荷/支撑处）；未截断的真实最大值仍会显示在状态行和图例中"

#: ui.py:82
msgid "Symbols"
msgstr "符号"

#: properties.py:204
msgid "The actual part to analyze -- this IS the analysis domain, voxelized and solved exactly as modeled (no material added or removed). Must be a closed (watertight) mesh"
msgstr "要分析的实际零件——它就是分析域，按建模原样体素化并求解（不增加或移除材料）。必须是封闭（水密）网格"

#: properties.py:263
msgid "Verbose solver log"
msgstr "详细求解器日志"

#: properties.py:312
msgid "Von Mises Stress"
msgstr "von Mises 应力"

#: ui.py:37
#: ui.py:60
msgid "VoxelSim FEA"
msgstr "VoxelSim FEA"

#: properties.py:325
msgid "VoxelSimFEA_StressCloud: one real, colored cube per active voxel (von Mises stress), near-zero elements dropped, with a Geometry Nodes clip plane (VoxelSimFEA_ClipPlane Empty) so you can slice into the part"
msgstr "VoxelSimFEA_StressCloud：每个活动体素对应一个真实的着色立方体（von Mises 应力），丢弃接近零的单元，并带有几何节点剖切平面（VoxelSimFEA_ClipPlane 空物体），以便剖切查看零件内部"

#: properties.py:217
msgid "Voxels along the part's longest edge. Higher = finer stress detail but much slower and more memory (cost grows roughly with the cube). 40-64 is a good start; raise for thin features the coarse grid might miss"
msgstr "沿零件最长边的体素数。数值越高，应力细节越精细，但速度更慢、内存占用更大（开销大致按三次方增长）。建议从 40-64 开始；对于粗网格可能漏掉的薄结构可适当提高"

#: properties.py:234
msgid "Weight each voxel's stiffness by the fraction of it that lies inside the part, instead of a plain inside/outside test. More accurate displacements on coarse grids, in particular with Grid Samples = 1; costs extra voxelization time"
msgstr "按体素位于零件内部的比例来加权其刚度，而不是简单判断在内部还是外部。在粗网格上位移更准确，尤其是网格采样 = 1 时；会增加体素化时间"

#: properties.py:182
msgid "Where an external force is applied. The force is spread over the grid nodes inside this mesh. Place a small closed mesh overlapping the part where the load acts"
msgstr "施加外力的位置。力会分布到该网格内部的网格节点上。在载荷作用处放置一个与零件重叠的小型封闭网格"

#: properties.py:126
msgid "Where the part is held / anchored. Grid nodes inside this mesh are clamped. Place a small closed mesh overlapping the part where it is actually supported"
msgstr "零件被固定/锚定的位置。该网格内部的网格节点会被约束。在实际支撑处放置一个与零件重叠的小型封闭网格"

#: properties.py:250
msgid "Which compute backend the solver uses for its one linear solve. Auto is right for almost everyone"
msgstr "求解器进行单次线性求解时使用的计算后端。几乎所有情况下用「自动」即可"

#: properties.py:307
msgid "Which single result object is visible right now -- every result from the last solve stays available in the 'VoxelSim FEA Results' collection, this just switches which one is shown (and drives the on-screen legend)"
msgstr "当前显示哪一个结果物体——上次求解的每个结果都保留在 'VoxelSim FEA Results' 集合中，此项只是切换显示哪一个（并同时控制屏幕图例）"

#: properties.py:382
msgid "Wireframe Helper-Objects"
msgstr "线框辅助物体"

