#: properties.py:296
msgid "Yield strength in MEGAPASCALS (MPa), used only to compute the safety-factor result (yield / von Mises stress). Set to 0 to disable the safety-factor result"
msgstr "屈服强度，单位兆帕（MPa），仅用于计算安全系数结果（屈服强度 / von Mises 应力）。设为 0 可禁用安全系数结果"

#: properties.py:285
msgid "Young's modulus in GIGAPASCALS (GPa). It sets the absolute displacement and stress scale. 1 GPa = 1000 MPa = 1e9 Pa"
msgstr "杨氏模量，单位吉帕（GPa）。它决定位移和应力的绝对量级。1 GPa = 1000 MPa = 1e9 Pa"

